{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c44f1a90-m04-4d20-9a11-tms-rsv",
    "name": "TMS — M04 Stock Reservation",
    "description": "M04 Stock Reservation — Node port **3001**, No UI.\n\nAnswers: **which terminal racks this quantity of this product on this date, and is it committed?**\n\nStock is reserved only for a **CONFIRMED** trip on a **LIVE** plan. A DRAFT returns 409 `ROUTE_NOT_CONFIRMED`. A SCENARIO returns 409 `SCENARIO_PLAN` and writes nothing.\n\n## Outcomes\n- **RESERVED** — declared availability covers the qualified quantity (including an exact match)\n- **SHORT** — a declaration exists and this reservation exceeds what is left. Still committed. Never auto-cancelled.\n- **UNVERIFIED** — nobody has declared availability. Still committed. `availableQty` is null, not zero.\n\nThe quantity is `qualified_qty`. Conversion uses the UOM `factor_to_base` (KL is seeded). A terminal that does not rack the product is not a candidate. No terminal racks it → 422 `NO_RACKABLE_TERMINAL` and no reservation row.\n\nM05 route tables are not in this repo. The confirm call carries the trip (`routeId`, `planKind`, `plannedDeparture`, `orders`).\n\n## Setup\n1. `npm run api:sql` then restart `npm run api`.\n2. Set `login` and `password`.\n3. Set `orderId` to a QUALIFIED bulk order (not packed).\n4. Set `terminalId` and `materialId` to a shipping point and material the terminal racks (id or code).\n5. Set `toTerminalId` to a different terminal that also racks that product, for reassignment.\n6. Run folder **0. Login** (saves `token`).\n7. Port **3001**, not 3000. No trailing slash.\n\nEvery POST, PUT, and PATCH sends `Idempotency-Key`. A token with no permission list may reassign immediately. A token that has permissions but not `override.approve` gets 202 and the terminal does not move until **43 Countersign**.\n\n## Base paths\n`/api/v1/ops/trips/:tripId/reservations`\n`/api/v1/ops/reservations`\n`/api/v1/ops/terminal-stock`\n\n## Variables saved by scripts\n`token`, `reservationId`, `versionNo`, `qualifiedQty`, `reservedQtyUom`, `declareKey`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
